    "long_instructions": "## **Finding Restaurants**\r\n\r\n1. Sort the starter cards into the ISPO stages.\r\n\r\n2. If you notice a missing step, use a blank card to add it.\r\n\r\n3. **Stuck?** Ask: What does the app know without you typing it? What might happen behind the scenes?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
